## Optional tooling dependencies

LazyBuddy may provision the following tools only through caller-selected,
receipt-owned lifecycle commands. They are not LazyCodex or OmO dependencies
and are not installed globally or into a target repository.

- `@vscode/ripgrep`, MIT:
  https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-ripgrep
- `@ast-grep/cli`, MIT:
  https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep
- `@colbymchenry/codegraph`, MIT:
  https://github.com/colbymchenry/codegraph
- `typescript`, Apache-2.0:
  https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript
- `typescript-language-server`, Apache-2.0:
  https://github.com/typescript-language-server/typescript-language-server
- `basedpyright`, MIT:
  https://github.com/detachhead/basedpyright

